  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Bunu!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420075006E007500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yo! Remember me? ’Cause I sure remember you.\nYou were a big help with that big ol’ Bunnelby.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But all I could do back then was stand back and\nwatch you battle the beast, completely useless.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And that feeling lit a FIRE in my heart!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0064002000740068006100740020006600650065006C0069006E00670020006C00690074002000610020004600490052004500200069006E0020006D0079002000680065006100720074002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wanted to be just as strong as you are!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000770061006E00740065006400200074006F0020006200650020006A0075007300740020006100730020007300740072006F006E006700200061007300200079006F00750020006100720065002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve actually been working pretty darn hard since\nthen.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI realized I had to start over from scratch, both as\na Trainer and as a traveler.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Now it’s time to see the results!\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nThis<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntime<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nyou’re<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ngonna<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbattle ME!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 18,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll show you what I can do with the team of buds\nI’ve built up big ol’ bonds with!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oooh, I’m getting chills. Or maybe these are\npre-battle jitters?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAnyway, you just tell me when you’re ready for a\nbig ol’ battle!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "From the fact that you’re talking to me, I take it\nyou’re all ready for battle?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ready as I’ll ever be!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065006100640079002000610073002000492019006C006C0020006500760065007200200062006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not exactly",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0074002000650078006100630074006C00790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK! Then shall we get this show on the road?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004B00210020005400680065006E0020007300680061006C006C002000770065002000670065007400200074006800690073002000730068006F00770020006F006E002000740068006500200072006F00610064003F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "BUNAAAL!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420055004E004100410041004C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Here we go...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650072006500200077006500200067006F002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "WITNESS...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700490054004E004500530053002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OUR BIG OL’...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0055005200200042004900470020004F004C2019002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "BOOONDS!!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042004F004F004F004E0044005300210021002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’mon, Bunnelby! Our bond is the biggest and\ngreatest of all! Let’s show ’em!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’ve gotta admit, catching and raising all those\nalphas sure was a big endeavor, right?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s just something about alphas. It’s like\nthey’re overflowing with nature’s power!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wonder if the whole world used to be overrun\nwith alphas way back when... Can you imagine?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s so much to see and discover out there...\nIt fills me with wonder!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI was born and raised here in Lumiose, but that\nwonder is what got me traveling in the first place.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 181
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now I know there are new discoveries still waiting\nfor me, even back home.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It sorta made me realize something, y’know?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049007400200073006F0072007400610020006D0061006400650020006D00650020007200650061006C0069007A006500200073006F006D0065007400680069006E0067002C002000792019006B006E006F0077003F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Doesn’t matter if you’re in some foreign land or\nyour own backyard. Every day can be a journey!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWhat’s important is what you get out of your\nexperiences, wherever you are.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 179
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I think I’ll enjoy a bit more time here at home and\nsee where the journey of life takes me.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bun bun!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420075006E002000620075006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks for the battle, pal. Someday I’ll manage to\nbeat you—you’ll see!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    }
